  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO Decent Jobs for Youth and Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth unemployment in Tunisia is very high and the project aims to create more access to work for young men and women in targeted governorates. The project aims to deliver relevant policies and services for youth employment through labour market institutions and social partners on national and local level. Further, the vulnerability of youth in the labour market is to be reduced through empoyability and job creation programmes in the targeted governorates.</narrative>
  </description>
